WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.403 --> 00:00:04.620
Unit eighteen. Road Traffic Injury Prevention!

2
00:00:05.568 --> 00:00:09.637
Hello, everyone! I'm Doctor Sokha, your school doctor.

3
00:00:09.687 --> 00:00:13.233
Hi, Doctor Sokha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:13.283 --> 00:00:18.004
Today we learn about Road Traffic Injury Prevention. Let's go!

5
00:00:18.993 --> 00:00:23.376
Road safety. Say it with me. Road safety!

6
00:00:26.910 --> 00:00:30.660
Speed. Say it with me. Speed!

7
00:00:34.110 --> 00:00:37.877
Helmet. Say it with me. Helmet!

8
00:00:41.396 --> 00:00:45.713
Seatbelt. Say it with me. Seatbelt!

9
00:00:49.176 --> 00:00:53.510
Drink driving. Say it with me. Drink driving!

10
00:00:57.039 --> 00:01:01.289
Distraction. Say it with me. Distraction!

11
00:01:04.787 --> 00:01:08.921
Enforcement. Say it with me. Enforcement!

12
00:01:12.437 --> 00:01:16.937
Infrastructure. Say it with me. Infrastructure!

13
00:01:20.418 --> 00:01:34.974
Road traffic injuries can be prevented. Controlling speed, wearing a helmet and seatbelt, and stopping drink driving and distraction save lives. Enforcement and safe infrastructure also help.

14
00:01:35.024 --> 00:01:38.517
Now I understand. Thank you, Doctor Sokha!

15
00:01:39.215 --> 00:01:44.521
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:44.571 --> 00:01:45.721
Helmet!

17
00:01:46.564 --> 00:01:51.716
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:51.766 --> 00:01:52.961
Enforcement!

19
00:01:54.116 --> 00:02:01.007
Did you know? Slowing traffic down even a little greatly reduces the risk of death for pedestrians!

20
00:02:01.057 --> 00:02:03.381
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:02:04.437 --> 00:02:13.125
Think and answer. Which road safety change would help your community most?

22
00:02:13.175 --> 00:02:14.325
Great answer!

23
00:02:15.286 --> 00:02:21.136
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:21.186 --> 00:02:24.066
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

